  "operative_text": "SECTION 1 (Section 23-31-240): Notwithstanding any other provision contained in this article, the following persons who possess a valid permit pursuant to this article may carry a concealable weapon anywhere within this State, when carrying out the duties of their office: (12) active workers' compensation commissioners; and (13) clerks of court."
